# A plain registration against a server offering a modest capability set.
# Lines starting with < are sent by the server. Everything else is a comment.
< :irc.example.org CAP * LS :multi-prefix server-time message-tags batch echo-message sasl=PLAIN,EXTERNAL away-notify
< :irc.example.org CAP * ACK :multi-prefix
< :irc.example.org CAP * ACK :server-time
< :irc.example.org CAP * ACK :message-tags
< :irc.example.org CAP * ACK :batch
< :irc.example.org CAP * ACK :echo-message
< :irc.example.org CAP * NAK :sasl
< :irc.example.org CAP * ACK :away-notify
< :irc.example.org 001 me :Welcome to the Example Network
< :irc.example.org 005 me CASEMAPPING=rfc1459 CHANTYPES=#^$ PREFIX=(qaohv)~&@%+ CHANMODES=beI,k,l,imnpst :are supported by this server
< PING :abc123
